  "snippet": "\nEmacs? You fiend.  My mua is pine.\n\nJason L. Weisberger\nChief of Network Operations\nSoftAware, Inc.\nHere is another option.  If you want the exact emacs binding, feel free\nto ask Noah.\n\n-Bob\nI read my mime mail in emacs, of course, which does everything other than\nS/MIME signature/encryption/decryption at the moment (but you can do things\nwith PGP).\n\nHooray for competing encryption standards.\n",
